            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "> and how would cursor state cleanup happen?\n\nI think we need namespace/extmark hooks. https://github.com/neovim/neovim/blob/7c194c9ef986ef4a3e4ab52aadba507f2c3d0126/src/nvim/extmark.c#L302-L304\n\nI don't see why we would design this only for multicursor specifically.\n\n> cursor can move (out of the range of the extmarks and possible into unrelated extmarks)\n\n?? I think some insight is missing from the issue description...",
